[232.924484, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m12\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[232.92584, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ve confirmed the base model loads and the full multiple-choice prompt fits within 256 tokens. Next I’m benchmarking CPU training and designing the supervised \r\nprompt format.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport json,time,torch\r\nfrom transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM\r\nfrom peft import LoraConfig, get_peft_model, TaskType\r\ntorch.set_num_threads(20)\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('openai-community/gpt2'); tok.pad_token=tok.eos_token\r\nm=AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained('openai-community/gpt2')\r\ncfg=LoraConfig(r=8,lora_alpha=16,target_modules=['c_attn'],task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,lora_dropout=0.05)\r\nm=get_peft_model(m,cfg)\r\nd=json.load(open('/app/data/train.json'))[:8]\r\ntexts=[]\r\nfor s in d:\r\n p=f\"Question: {s['question']}\\nOptions:\\n\"+'\\n'.join(s['options'])+f\"\\nAnswer: {s['answer']}\"\r\n texts.append(p+tok.eos_token)\r\nenc=tok(texts,padding=True,truncation=True,max_length=256,return_tensors='pt')\r\nlabels=enc.input_ids.clone(); labels[enc.attention_mask==0]=-100\r\n# o"]
[232.92592, "o", "nly answer tokens: find replacement. mask via tokenizing prompt lengths\r\nfor i,s in enumerate(d):\r\n p=f\"Question: {s['question']}\\nOptions:\\n\"+'\\n'.join(s['options'])+\"\\nAnswer:\"\r\n plen=len(tok(p)['input_ids'])\r\n labels[i,:plen]=-100\r\nopt=torch.optim.AdamW([p for p in m.parameters() if p.requires_grad],lr=5e-4)\r\nm.train()\r\nt=time.time()\r\nout=m(**enc,labels=labels); loss=out.loss\r\nloss.backward(); opt.step(); opt.zero_grad()\r\nprint('loss',float(loss),'time',time.time()-t,'seq shapes',enc.input_ids.shape,'trainable',sum(p.numel() for p in m.parameters() if p.requires_grad))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[232.926065, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
