[923.272294, "o", "\r\u001b[2KEarly validation plateaus around 30%, so direct single-token SFT is not sufficient. I’ll stop this run and analyze prediction patterns before switching to a \r\nstronger contrastive multiple-choice objective.\r\n\r\n```\r\nkill $(cat /app/train.pid) 2>/dev/null || true; sleep 2; kill -0 $(cat /app/train.pid) 2>/dev/null && kill -9 $(cat /app/train.pid) || true; echo stopped; ls \r\n-la /app/experiments/lora_adapter; cat /app/experiments/lora_adapter/adapter_config.json 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
